{"id":"26644165863707d2","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-set11-cumulative-universe-slice.md","title":"ZFC Set11 Cumulative Universe Slice","display":"df-zfc-set11-cumulative-universe-slice — ZFC Set11 Cumulative Universe Slice","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set11-cumulative-universe-slice","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set11-cumulative-universe-slice"],"display":"df-zfc-set11-cumulative-universe-slice — ZFC Set11 Cumulative Universe Slice","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[58-df-hierarchy]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set11-cumulative-universe-slice"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set11-cumulative-universe-slice</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set11-cumulative-universe-slice — ZFC Set11 Cumulative Universe Slice"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"19e9a8c33d5c841c\" href=\"?note=19e9a8c33d5c841c\" title=\"58-df-hierarchy\">58-df-hierarchy</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,\\alpha,\\beta \\in V\">\\(S,\\alpha,\\beta \\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\gamma\">\\(V_\\gamma\\)</span> is the cumulative-hierarchy level from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"19e9a8c33d5c841c\" href=\"?note=19e9a8c33d5c841c\" title=\"58-df-hierarchy\">58-df-hierarchy</a> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> is from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet11CumulativeUniverseSlice}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet11CumulativeUniverseSlice}_S\\)</span> is the three-place predicate defined below</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set11\\text{-}cumulative\\text{-}universe\\text{-}slice} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet11CumulativeUniverseSlice}_S(S,\\alpha,\\beta)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\\alpha\\leq\\beta\\land S=V_\\beta\\setminus V_\\alpha\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set11\\text{-}cumulative\\text{-}universe\\text{-}slice} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet11CumulativeUniverseSlice}_S(S,\\alpha,\\beta)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\\alpha\\leq\\beta\\land S=V_\\beta\\setminus V_\\alpha\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\beta\\setminus V_\\alpha\">\\(V_\\beta\\setminus V_\\alpha\\)</span> 正好由秩位于区间 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\alpha,\\beta)\">\\([\\alpha,\\beta)\\)</span> 的集合组成；序数参数保证两个累计层有定义。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zf